; ── Mei · Blood Witch ────────────────────────────────────────────
; Battle focus: Red-color power  ＋  Crimson Night (ATK x2)  ＋  Four-color combo

@stopBgm
@bgm intense
@back bg03 time:0.3
@char 魅兒 pos:50 time:0

魅兒.rage: You're challenging me? If you dare — Blood Curse!

@choice "Challenge accepted!" goto:.battle_intro
@stop

# battle_intro
魅兒.talking: Hmph, don't underestimate blood magic — I can make you suffer with my own blood.
魅兒.idle: But... if you can knock me down, I'll admit you have some real skill.

@hide 魅兒
@battle background:bg03 target:monster01 scriptName:demo label:result_mei
@stop
